{"2026.6.13:P04-Q02":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>电子轨道与化学结构表示</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 实验中学 · 第2题 · P04-Q02</div><h1>电子轨道与化学结构表示</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/化学用语</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：通过轨道图、VSEPR模型和高分子结构判断化学用语。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/基态原子的核外电子排布原则</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的构型及相关理论</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/化学键/共价键</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/合成有机高分子化合物/合成有机高分子的基本方法</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H-1  C-12  N-14  O-16  S-32  K-39  Cu-64</p><p>2. 生物质气(主要成分为<img src=\"chem-asset:c6125c3a9004e3dbe3c2ae903788662242c3e24d6f54192467849bc9be0cd34c:0;\" style=\"width:25.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:1475667f7090075e3b123ec6b4e0ef1ed7fb5d41ac209d700f21928931fc9bbf:1;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:7b78a385074ad3b11e6ac243fad3197ed6618619fb667fba02f2b69dde0da788:2;\" style=\"width:22.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">等)经含铬催化剂催化合成甲醇和水，甲醇在铁钼氧化物作用下可得到甲醛。下列化学用语或图示错误的是</p><p>A. 基态<img src=\"chem-asset:51fc92730996f31543ad6a4ddfdf2aec9bde489e0d48d24c148cfca775187241:3;\" style=\"width:21.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">原子价层电子的轨道表示式：<img src=\"chem-asset:3f66c3a722dc034651d2fa3788f49101c6edf7a55f5b7c3cc2d2a8162922a69b:4;\" style=\"width:155.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 甲醛与苯酚的缩聚产物线型酚醛树脂的结构简式：<img src=\"chem-asset:6b2827b92b543eb5632cc1ca4d083514000402851e7f360755b6ec51173c53cf:5;\" style=\"width:148.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:525f5066daf2ca3bca18f1e9590a623e24970b0cc53d611b5cbe91abe57339fb:6;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的价层电子对互斥模型：<img src=\"chem-asset:454e25106d20b016b4940cd185e1528bf20738e51eed672dbec88114196fa074:7;\" style=\"width:62.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:bb87aae25d1a613d6b1dea0b5dde69977cf75753597459bb0968cf09989ed643:8;\" style=\"width:27.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中σ键形成的轨道重叠示意图：<img src=\"chem-asset:c4bb5e660665a92b64245abe3acb5c81dd0f794a5ac809e4788a5ae1af173658:9;\" style=\"width:260.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．基态<img src=\"chem-asset:01c22c3e1b9a59621ebf927a41f6f00b3827055facdc942b7ea3fd1ec6fa9a83:10;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">原子价层电子排布式为<img src=\"chem-asset:b7b12485699835d524ddf5a479d51b2ab4b2fac66bed30152838ecc54b56fcf4:11;\" style=\"width:45.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A不符合题意；</p><p>B．甲醛与苯酚先发生加成反应生成<img src=\"chem-asset:2c7eba3c12237abbd76537166975c9cc497befff47f23e104d68c8c33c9cce33:12;\" style=\"width:104.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:2c7eba3c12237abbd76537166975c9cc497befff47f23e104d68c8c33c9cce33:12;\" style=\"width:98.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">脱水缩聚生成<img src=\"chem-asset:6b2827b92b543eb5632cc1ca4d083514000402851e7f360755b6ec51173c53cf:5;\" style=\"width:129.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B不符合题意；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:525f5066daf2ca3bca18f1e9590a623e24970b0cc53d611b5cbe91abe57339fb:6;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中心<img src=\"chem-asset:2c9d0325a6c1b84f2668177f445547966147c1fc9382603f5bdb26ebd1247b79:13;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">原子价层电子对数为<img src=\"chem-asset:c1a6df020fe833b320c88f90b866eb1bb0f571814ae587bf706c43c2811c6255:14;\" style=\"width:148.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，有2个孤电子对，价层电子对互斥模型为四面体形，C不符合题意；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:bb87aae25d1a613d6b1dea0b5dde69977cf75753597459bb0968cf09989ed643:8;\" style=\"width:27.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中<img src=\"chem-asset:4b9b717e2ddab8fa6872263bd3b3546a1a415840ae6fd3ab117b318afcca4f69:15;\" style=\"width:13.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键是原子轨道头碰头重叠形成的，图示过程为p-p轨道肩并肩重叠形成π键的过程，D符合题意；</p><p>答案选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南长沙市实验中学2026届高三第九次阶段性测试 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南长沙市实验中学2026届高三第九次阶段性测试 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙市实验中学2026届高三第九次阶段性测试 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.13/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E7%AC%AC%E4%B9%9D%E6%AC%A1%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%A7%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E7%AC%AC%E4%B9%9D%E6%AC%A1%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%A7%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原 Word 文件</a></p><p class=\"muted\">原文定位：第2题。共享材料随整题保留，小问标签用于检索。</p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["01c22c3e1b9a59621ebf927a41f6f00b3827055facdc942b7ea3fd1ec6fa9a83","1475667f7090075e3b123ec6b4e0ef1ed7fb5d41ac209d700f21928931fc9bbf","2c7eba3c12237abbd76537166975c9cc497befff47f23e104d68c8c33c9cce33","2c9d0325a6c1b84f2668177f445547966147c1fc9382603f5bdb26ebd1247b79","3f66c3a722dc034651d2fa3788f49101c6edf7a55f5b7c3cc2d2a8162922a69b","454e25106d20b016b